WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.055
Welcome to Module 4 of the Azure
Security Engineering learning path:

2
00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:07.250
Private Link, D N S and Key Vault.

3
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:12.688
A private endpoint gives a pass resource
an address inside the agency's network,

4
00:00:12.688 --> 00:00:15.325
and D N S decides whether anyone uses it.

5
00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:19.000
The secrets and keys a workload
needs belong in a vault that

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.975
only its managed identity and
eligible administrators can use.

7
00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:27.554
This module takes pass off the internet,
starting with Key Vault, and puts

8
00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:32.362
the vault itself behind role-based
access, purge protection and an audit log.

9
00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:37.591
It covers Steps 7 and 8 of the Azure
Security Engineering implementation guide,

10
00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:42.240
and takes about fifty minutes, plus
a lab in your own test subscription.
